Find stored keys of either parity when descriptors reload in x-only form. Accept x-only representations of stored HD roots during private derivation checks while retaining exact full-key verification for exported scalars.

Cover both parities, wallet reload and encryption, and HD roots used as internal or leaf keys. Clarify that a direct address can identify an HD master private key.
